{"slug":"fall-detection","title":"Fall detection","desc":"Our fall detection feature uses three factors that mimic a falling motion to raise an alarm. When detected, our devices or app it will raise an alarm.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/fall-detection-hero.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Fall Detection Alarm\",\"title\":\"Fall Detection\",\"intro\":\"Raise an alarm without pressing a button\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/fall-detection-hero.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why use a fall detection system?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"How our fall detection system works?\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/Fallen-down-worker-resized-2048x1366-1-e1645183278565-1024x614.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our patented <a href=\"/uk/blogs/what-is-a-fall-detection-alarm/\">fall detection</a> feature uses three factors that mimic a falling motion to raise an alarm. When fall detection is enabled on one of our devices or app it will raise an alarm once it detects three events</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A fall from a height,</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A period of non-movement and,</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A change in orientation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Slip and fall detection response faster than 999\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/841920708\",\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our team of responders are available 24 hours a day all year long and are on hand to offer rapid response to the activation of a fall detection device. Our team responds to alarm activation faster than 999, allowing for a fast resolution to your employee’s slip, trip or fall.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With our fall detection systems, you benefit from:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>3 seconds to pick up alarms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 minute police response in threat-to-life situations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100% service uptime</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/related-content {\"title\":\"Implement fall detection on these products\",\"items\":[{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:mysos@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:lone-worker-app@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:mysos-id-badge-4g@@\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eGet in touch if you would like more information about our fall detection feature.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fall detection alarm systems you can trust</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Peoplesafe, we understand that employee safety and workplace compliance are paramount. That is why we hold all the relevant accreditations for the products we provide and the alarm receiving centre we operate.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We ensure complete adherence to best practices and ensure all services match legislation and industry guidelines. Being committee members of the BSIA Lone Worker section further enhances our standing as our role ensures we continually advise and work with key industry representatives and regulatory bodies such as the NPCC and BSI.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/faq {\"title\":\"Fall Detection FAQs\",\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"Who should use a fall detection device?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eLone workers carrying out tasks at height are among the most common users of Peoplesafe fall detection systems, but they can also be adopted by any employee working alone where safety could be compromised. This extends to NHS workers doing home visits, estate agents hosting viewings and so much more. Wherever there is a possibility of a slip, trip or fall, Peoplesafe is there to provide round-the-clock assistance.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Can I have a fall detection alarm on my phone?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. With Peoplesafe you can. Our easy to install lone worker safety app transforms your phone into a fall detection alarm that operates in much the same way as our physical devices.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"What type of fall detection devices do Peoplesafe provide?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe currently have three physical devices and one app in our range. The app simply gets added to your smartphone whilst the devices can be worn discreetly and provide rapid response should an employee have a fall. Our current range includes the MySOS personal safety alarm, our flagship personal safety device, the Micro SOS personal safety alarm, its compact smaller brother and the MySOS ID badge 4G, a name badge with added safety features.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Are Peoplesafe fall detection systems fully accredited?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. Every device or app we have is fully accredited to BS 8484:2022 for lone working.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Can I book a demo to see how Peoplesafe fall detection systems work?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOf course! We would love you to see how our employee fall detection alarms work. Simply book a demo today and our team will ensure you get to see the complete range of benefits our systems bring to your workforce.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"How quickly can your fall detection alarms detect a fall?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOur systems are built to provide you with a rapid response to a slip, trip or fall. Should an employee fall from height, have a period of non-movement and change orientation, the alarm activates instantly and connects to our alarm receiving centre. Alarms are picked up within three seconds and where there is a threat-to-life, police response is as little as 4 minutes.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /-->","menu_order":22,"types":["features"]}